{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201280","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620128001:1":{"text":"돌아왔구나. 어때, 레시피는 찾았니?","source_cn":"你们回来了。怎么样，找到配方了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9B9149C21447A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620128002:1":{"text":"마스터가 찾았어요! 여기요!","source_cn":"主人已经找到啦，就在这里！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC7457B0C06E291C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터가 찾았어요! 여기요!","female":"마스터가 찾았어요! 여기요!","variant_male_record_index":"197291","variant_female_record_index":"197292","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1620128003:1":{"text":"아나치카는 기존 레시피를 조용히 읽은 뒤, 잠시 생각에 잠겼다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEDC75E35704A658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620128004:1":{"text":"그래, 비츠와프의 추측이 맞구나. 돌돌이가 영체가 되었으니 기존의 부작용을 고려할 필요가 없어졌어. 조금만 손보면 효과가 있을 거야.","source_cn":"嗯，维茨瓦夫的猜测是正确的。既然小石头已经成为了灵体，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9795FBFDF815249E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620128005:1":{"text":"레시피는 조정해 두었으니 포션은 너희가 만들 거라.","source_cn":"配方我已经调整好了，辛苦你们帮忙调配吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB2B88EA0C37A82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620128006:1":{"text":"어디 보자... “순서대로 <style=\"highlight\">안정초</style>, <style=\"highlight\">평온의 잎</style>, <style=\"highlight\">꿀열매</style>를 넣어서 녹을 때까지 달인 뒤 영체에게 바른다...”","source_cn":"我看看。“依次加入<style=highlight>宁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD28C72D31C0C1491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620128007:1":{"text":"어라, 꿀열매는 왜 넣는 거예요? 설마 특별한 효과가 있는 건가요? 음... 영체에 대한 효과를 강화하거나, 안정시킨다거나...","source_cn":"咦，为什么要加蜜果？难道是有什么特别的疗效，比如……唔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A8C222E3666F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620128008:2":{"text":"별다른 효과는 없으니 추측하지 말거라. 그냥 내 개인적인 사심일 뿐이야.","source_cn":"不用猜了，它没有任何疗效。这只是我个人的一点私心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9955665ED12498","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620128009:1":{"text":"돌돌이가 꿀열매를 좋아했거든. 하지만 고양이는 육식동물이라 많이 먹이지 못했단다.","source_cn":"小石头很喜欢吃蜜果，但因为猫是肉食动物，我一直不让它多吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5144A56D25D00BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620128010:1":{"text":"하지만 이제는 고양이 영체가 되었으니 상관없지 않니. 좋아하는 걸 먹여주고 싶은 마음일 뿐이야.","source_cn":"现在它已经变成猫灵了，也不在乎这些了。我就想让它能吃点...",